  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": {
    "@es": "Profesiones y tareas",
    "@en": "Professions and tasks"
   },
   "texto": [
    {
     "@es": "**iş** = trabajo; **meslek** = profesión; **ofis** = oficina.",
     "@en": "**iş** = work; **meslek** = profession; **ofis** = office."
    },
    {
     "@es": "**çalışmak** puede significar trabajar o estudiar, según el contexto.",
     "@en": "**çalışmak** may mean working or studying, depending on the context."
    },
    {
     "@es": "El presente habitual describe tareas: **doktor hastaları muayene eder** = el médico examina a los pacientes.",
     "@en": "The usual present describes tasks: **doktor hastaları muayene eder** = the doctor examines the patients."
    }
   ]
  },
